      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "VICTA KREV (2) was out of the placings last time when eighth at Angle Park (31.63) but did record best time of the card when winning four back. Has never missed the frame here at the trip from three starts. Form from his last run is proving to be solid. Rates on top in this line up. LITTLE LOCKETT (6) is a super honest type rarely out of the placings, including wins at her last three on end, the latest at Murray Bridge (39.75). Form at this distance is sound. Expected to feature on best form. DURAN PANTERA (8) posted a fast 30.57 winning over 530m at Angle Park last start in a Grade 5. This tougher but expected to be in the finish. JAZZY HOPE (1) warrants respect although new to this track.",
